Executive Summary & Overall Conclusions (What We Learned Overall)
Regional Performance Disconnect: Mansoura stands out as the most valuable commercial hub—leading in total balances, transaction volume, and positive net cash flow—whereas Alexandria underperforms across balances, transaction volume, and cash flow despite branch presence.

Retail-Driven Retail Lending: The retail segment is the primary engine for both daily transaction traffic and loan volume, with Car and Personal loans accounting for over 74% of all monthly installment returns.

High Portfolio Quality: With 34.53M in loan profit generated from 237M in total loans and minimal default volumes, the credit division maintains strong risk-adjusted profitability across all operating regions.
